  "result": "NativeHistoryCost and NativeHistoryGuard compile under Lean 4.35.0 with core Lean only (no Mathlib), with no warnings. Every theorem of both modules was audited with Lean.collectAxioms; every axiom set is a subset of propext and Quot.sound.",
  "proof_boundary": "This receipt records that the sources type-check and which axioms their theorems use. It changes no DAG node status. The modules formalize one assertion cell of the Source-25 transition system, not the full interpreter, and not its correspondence with any native or Python implementation.",
