  "reproduction": "In a scratch Lake package with a lean_lib NativeHistory over the two byte-identical sources (FQM lean4/ requires Mathlib, which this container cannot fetch), run `lake build NativeHistory`, then Lean.collectAxioms over every theorem constant of both modules. From FQM lean4/ with Mathlib available, `lake build NativeHistory` builds the same sources.",
